          "The bench report requisition readiness evidence dictionary lists each field, its source system, its expected format, and the person who owns it. The bench report requisition readiness sample is pulled from the frozen population and stored with the query used to read the applicant tracking system. The sample addresses whether the bench was checked before external search. The bench availability report supplies the request date; the open requisition in the hiring plan supplies the close date; the placement agreement is used to test the join. The analyst records the export time beside every field that can change. A field without an owner is treated as unreliable.",
