          "A bench report requisition readiness case can be affected by customer availability, source quality, staffing changes, and handoff timing. The bench report requisition readiness population is built from the bench availability report and checked against the open requisition in the hiring plan through the placement agreement. The study turns on whether the bench was checked before external search. The protocol describes one defined population and does not establish a universal standard. The client hiring panel checks that the limitation is written beside the finding. The team repeats the review only after the definition and source are stable.",
