          "For bench report requisition readiness, the working file separates the raw export, the cleaned dataset, and the published table. The bench report requisition readiness definition separates a missing record in the bench availability report from a pending decision in the open requisition in the hiring plan. The measure must answer whether the bench was checked before external search. The analyst records every transformation and the person who approved it. The talent delivery lead confirms that the report names the observation window and the exclusions. The file is retained under the same rule as the source record.",
